  "description": "After the death of her mother, Kang Ji-Yul lives a lethargic life, secluded in her mansion. Then, Cha Seon-Tae, a former gangster, enters her mansion as the new gardener. With a brazen attitude, Seon-Tae begins to mock Ji-Yul, calling her the 'princess in the castle,' and slowly begins to shake up her daily routine...\n\n\"I got turned on watching you get turned on.\" \n\n\"I'm curious. Curious about what you'll be like when you're properly in heat.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1716003086)",
